### ClearWood Furnitures — Prompt 1 (Foundation) endpoint checks
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request".
### Start the API first:  npm run dev:backend

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7180
@apiPrefix = /api/v1
@webOrigin = http://localhost:7181
@adminOrigin = http://localhost:7182

### 1. Liveness — 200, touches no dependency
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Readiness — 200 when sqlite + memory cache answer, otherwise 503 with per-dependency detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Accept: application/json

### 3. Build info + the driver each dependency is bound to
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/version
Accept: application/json

### 4. Public settings — flat, typed key/value map (seeded, admin-editable)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public
Accept: application/json

### 5. Public settings filtered by group
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public?group=site
Accept: application/json

### 6. Invalid query -> 422 with per-issue details (R2)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public?group=NOT%20VALID
Accept: application/json

### 7. Unknown route -> 404 error envelope with a traceId (R3)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### 8. Malformed JSON body -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/version
Content-Type: application/json

{"broken":

### 9. A caller-supplied correlation id is echoed back as the traceId
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
x-request-id: manual-trace-id-0001

### 10. CORS preflight from the storefront origin -> allowed
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public
Origin: {{webOrigin}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type,x-request-id

### 11. CORS preflight from the admin origin -> allowed
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public
Origin: {{adminOrigin}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### 12. CORS from an origin outside the allowlist -> 403 CORS_ORIGIN_NOT_ALLOWED (R10)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/settings/public
Origin: http://evil.example.com

### 13. Generated OpenAPI document (R7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json

### 14. Swagger UI (open in a browser): http://localhost:7180/docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/
